{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777272449640","title":"API call adalah pintu masuk developer ke AI","desc":"Momen ketika AI berubah dari bidang orang lain menjadi sesuatu yang bisa dipanggil dan diintegrasikan dengan skill developer biasa.","updated":1777282015599,"created":1777272449632,"tags":["zettel","ai","developer","integration","the-developers-guide-to-ai","part-i"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"798e95c81847448b8fb0503342ee3188","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","id":"zettel.1777272449640","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","id":"zettel.1777272449640","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","id":"zettel.1777272449640","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.developer","alias":"developer","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.developer"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","id":"zettel.1777272449640","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.integration","alias":"integration","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.integration"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","id":"zettel.1777272449640","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","id":"zettel.1777272449640","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.part-i","alias":"part-i","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.part-i"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","id":"zettel.1777272449640","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1264},"end":{"line":24,"column":51,"offset":1312},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449640","id":"zettel.1777272449640","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":3,"offset":1315},"end":{"line":25,"column":48,"offset":1360},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","id":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":3,"offset":799},"end":{"line":13,"column":27,"offset":823},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449640"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"quote-baseline":{"type":"header","text":"Quote baseline","value":"quote-baseline","line":21,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-core":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini core","value":"kenapa-ini-core","line":25,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":29,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":36,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"api-call-adalah-pintu-masuk-developer-ke-ai\">API call adalah pintu masuk developer ke AI<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#api-call-adalah-pintu-masuk-developer-ke-ai\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Yang gue tangkap dari quote ini adalah bahwa adopsi AI jadi realistis untuk developer ketika AI tidak lagi dibingkai sebagai riset misterius, tapi sebagai service yang bisa dipanggil lewat API dan SDK. Itu bukan sekadar teknis; itu perubahan psikologis yang membuat mereka merasa \"oke, ini wilayah kita juga.\" </p>\n<h2 id=\"quote-baseline\">Quote baseline<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#quote-baseline\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Those companies were calling these LLMs through APIs and using SDKs. The team knew how to do that!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-core\">Kenapa ini core<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-core\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini penting karena dia menjatuhkan barrier mental terbesar: bukan teori AI yang belum dipahami, tapi perasaan bahwa AI berada di luar jangkauan kemampuan developer biasa. Saat mereka sadar API/SDK adalah pola yang sudah familiar, barulah adopsi AI terasa mungkin.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“The team knew how to do that” menunjukkan continuity skill: kemampuan panggil API dan pakai SDK tetap relevan di era AI.</li>\n<li>AI berubah dari \"black box research project\" menjadi software component dengan interface engineering yang jelas.</li>\n<li>Ini menandai langkah pertama yang realistis: eksperimen dengan calling model dulu, baru tingkatkan kalau perlu.</li>\n<li>Jadi, hambatan utama untuk masuk ke AI sering lebih soal mental model dan interface, bukan soal memahami semua detail jaringan saraf.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Part I</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">developer (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">integration (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">part-i (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"